   "body": "/claim mac/mac-mbp\n\nPlan (with #1285, one PR if the cause is shared; the claim and plan are on #1285):\n- Reproduce on the simulator at today's `dev-swift` (Réglages › Expérimental › modern composer on, compact iPhone): (a) insert a smiley from the picker, (b) type past ~12 lines at text size 100 %.\n- Capture at each step the values listed on #1285 / #1286: the bar's window frame, the keyboard end frame (and whether a frame notification fired after the sheet closed), the reader's and the bar's `safeAreaInsets.bottom`, the real container height against `layout.availableHeight`, `cardHeight`, `editorHeight`, the view hierarchy.\n- Name the culprit from the measurements, fix it, with a hosted test that fails without the fix (posted keyboard notifications) and keeps #853's interactive keyboard drag.\n- Draft PR, Fable review (author Opus), device check listed on #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
